t;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">►</span> use common abbreviations</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">►</span> don&#39;t include synonyms</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">►</span> combine multiple words into single-words with dashes</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">►</span> maximum of 5 tags, 25 chars per tag</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">►</span> tag characters: [a-z 0-9 + # - .]</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">►</span> delimit tags by space, semicolon, or comma</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-famil