   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\">As far as I know, this is not possible, because ReporteRs does not support LaTeX.<div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Fortunately, there are some very powerful packages for supporting tables in LaTeX such as the tables package, but you will probably need to learn some LaTeX to do all the other stuff you might want to do. <br><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/davidgohel/ReporteRs/issues/68\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/davidgohel/ReporteRs/issues/68&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792354621857000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1kT92yxx3SHknc_LCeATY2\">https://github.com/davidgohel/ReporteRs/issues/68</a><br></div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
